  "difficulty": "medium",
  "summary": "作者列天机、贪狼、天同、天梁关寿命；天同命必有天机三合事业，天梁会照可强化此作用，贪狼不在天同三合。吉凶仍须条件：天同旺命多吉少煞利寿，陷命多煞较不利，但不能断必早夭，也不能以福星保证长寿。古引「番」疑字不修。",
  "summary_en": "The author associates Tian Ji, Tan Lang, Tian Tong and Tian Liang with longevity. Tian Tong in Life is accompanied by Tian Ji in trine Career; Tian Liang’s participation may reinforce the claimed effect, while Tan Lang is not in Tian Tong’s trines. Favorability remains conditional: strong Tian Tong in Life with many benefics and few malefics favors longevity, while fallen placement with many malefics is less favorable. Neither certain early death nor guaranteed long life follows. Unclear Fan characters in the quoted verses are preserved.",
